Implemented baseline tooling:
    [x] IPMI power, sensor and boot-device commands through vpsexec
    [x] iDRAC RACADM power commands through vpsexec
    [x] PXE one-time BIOS/EFI boot selection and iPXE HTTPS script drafts
    [x] ESXi VM inventory, state and power commands
    [x] VMware Fusion vmrun inventory and soft lifecycle commands
    [x] cfgfarm host/vps/cloud and equivalent executable aliases

Future extensions:
    - Governed remote BMC endpoint inventory and credential references
    - DHCP/TFTP service and boot-image lifecycle management
    - Cloud provider provisioning adapters (cloud currently uses SSH contracts)
